     ],
     "value": "Inhibits amyloid precursor protein processing, probably by blocking BACE1 activity (PubMed:15286784). Enhances trafficking of the glutamate transporter SLC1A1/EAAC1 from the endoplasmic reticulum to the cell surface (By similarity). Plays a role in the translocation of SLC2A4/GLUT4 from intracellular membranes to the cell membrane which facilitates the uptake of glucose into the cell (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
